> For no rules, there's a 1-turn wizmode ascension walkthrough on the
> Nethack Wiki:
> >From http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/1-turn_ascension:
> "  1.  Wish ([^w]) for the Amulet of Yendor
>    2. Level teleport ([^v]) to the Plane of Earth
>    3. Level teleport to the Astral Plane
>    4. Wish for a (lawful/neutral/chaotic) altar
>    5. #offer the Amulet"
> Though I've tried this, and this actually takes two turns since you
> can't teleport directly to the Plane of Earth with the Amulet, you have
> to go up the staircase first.  (Otherwise you die.)

The desrciption (which I've never seen before, didn't know about this 
wiki) was a bit badly written, I've fixed it for them.

   1.  Level teleport ([^v]) to the Plane of Earth - use ? to see the 
menu and select the Plane of Earth ("-1" will not work), this will 
automagically also give you the Amulet of Yendor
   2. Level teleport to the Astral Plane
   3. Wish for a (lawful/neutral/chaotic) altar
   4. #offer the Amulet 

